{comment: Intro}
[G / / / C | G / / /]

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Lord, I [G]come, [C]I  con[G]-fess
Bowing [Em7]here I [D]find my [C]rest
Without [G]You I [C]fall [G]apart
You're the [Dsus]One that [D]guides my [C]heart
{end_of_verse}

